<h2>API Endpoints</h2>
<ul>
    <li>POST /api/auth/login - User login</li>
    <li>POST /api/auth/register - User registration</li>
    <li>GET /api/tables - Get all tables</li>
    <li>POST /api/reservations - Create reservation (requires auth)</li>
    <li>GET /api/reservations/my - Get my reservations (requires auth)</li>
    <li>GET /api/reservations - Get all reservations (admin only)</li>
</ul>